    a_folder_with_this_name_already_exists_in_this_pillar A folder with this name already exists in this pillar
    about About
    about_intro_audience_desc Aliolo supports learners who want structured review, parents and teachers who need approachable study content, and creators who organize and publish their own learning materials.
    about_intro_audience_title Who It Is For
    about_intro_desc Aliolo is a visual learning app built around simple study flows, flexible content organization, and steady progress over time.
    about_intro_start_desc Begin on the dashboard, choose a pillar, open a subject, and start with Learn. Save useful content to favorites so it is easier to revisit later.
    about_intro_start_title How to Start
    about_intro_title About Aliolo
    about_learn_discovery_desc Search, age filters, and source filters such as favorites, mine, and public library help you find the right content quickly.
    about_learn_discovery_title Discovery and Filtering
    about_learn_language_desc You can study content in different languages and adjust session settings in your profile to match your pace and current goals.
    about_learn_language_title Language and Mode Flexibility
    about_learn_media_desc Images, audio, and video can support recognition, pronunciation, and context when they are available in the learning content.
    about_learn_media_title Media Support
    about_learn_modes_desc Use Learn to build recognition and confidence, then switch to Test when you want stricter recall and faster review.
    about_learn_modes_title Learn and Test
    about_learn_title How You Learn
    about_organize_collections_desc Collections combine multiple subjects into one study flow, which is useful for mixed review and curated sets.
    about_organize_collections_title Collections
    about_organize_creation_desc Creators can organize their own content, keep it private while working, or expose it through the public library when it is ready.
    about_organize_creation_title Ownership and Visibility
    about_organize_folders_desc Folders group related subjects inside a pillar so larger content sets stay manageable.
    about_organize_folders_title Folders
    about_organize_subjects_desc Subjects are the main unit of study. They hold the cards you open in Learn and Test sessions.
    about_organize_subjects_title Subjects
    about_organize_title How Content Is Organized
    about_progress_goals_desc Your profile lets you tune daily goal targets, learn session size, test session size, and number of answers.
    about_progress_goals_title Daily Goals and Session Settings
    about_progress_social_desc Friends and leaderboard features make progress social without changing the core learning flow.
    about_progress_social_title Friends and Leaderboard
    about_progress_title Progress, Friends, and Leaderboard
    about_progress_xp_desc Aliolo tracks total XP, current streak, and max streak so progress feels visible across short and long study periods.
    about_progress_xp_title XP and Streaks
    about_support_docs_desc The in-app documentation page explains how the dashboard, study flows, and creator tools work today.
    about_support_docs_title Documentation
    about_support_feedback_desc Use feedback entry points across the app to report bugs, suggest improvements, or flag specific content issues with context.
    about_support_feedback_title Feedback and Reporting
    about_support_licenses_desc The licenses page lists Aliolo's commercial license first and then the bundled third-party package licenses.
    about_support_licenses_title Licenses
    about_support_onboarding_desc You can revisit onboarding at any time to review the app's main ideas and setup flow.
    about_support_onboarding_title Onboarding
    about_support_settings_desc UI language, theme mode, theme color, sound, sidebar placement, and documentation visibility can all be adjusted from settings.
    about_support_settings_title Personalization
    about_support_title Settings, Feedback, and Support
